    "detailed_description": "&quot;<strong>Jonas Willy Online</strong>&quot; is an online third-person shooter. You will find the following game modes:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Free for All:</strong> Classic Deathmatch.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Team Deathmatch:</strong> Classic Deathmatch with teams.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Domination:</strong> Capture and hold objectives to earn time. Reach the score limit to win.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Hard Point:</strong> Capture and hold the Harpoint to earn points and win.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Survival:</strong> No rebirths. Kill everyone to defeat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Team Survival:</strong> No rebirths. Kill everyone in the opposite team to defeat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>One Shot - One Kill:</strong> No time to think. One hit and you're dead.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Duel:</strong> 1 vs 1 Deathmatch. No rebirths. Be the first!</li></ul><br>There are also some characters to choose from and maps to master!<br><br>What are you waiting for? Join the battle and participate in this <i>madness</i>.",
